// checked here. Unit-tested from the portal repo (test/cyrus-liveassets.test.ts).
//
// The model authors assets as JSON spec files (no extra model calls): assets/textures|sounds|datapack|designs|
// creatures|itemmodels/<name>.json, assets/config/schema.json, assets/library.json. While a build runs:
//   - the spec being written right now rides the existing /live draft protocol (path + seq + from) as `assets.draft`;
//   - finished writes, validator verdicts and the final build land as typed events in a bounded ring:
//       {seq, at, type: "complete"|"problems"|"validated"|"dropped"|"built", kind, path, ...}
